<title>USA: Donnelley Enterprise drops on '96 outlook.</title>
<headline>Donnelley Enterprise drops on '96 outlook.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnelley Enterprise Solutions Inc's stock fell sharply after the company said that it expects to post 1996 results that are &quot;substantially&quot; below street expectations.</p>
<p>Donnelley Enterprise was off 11-1/2 at 12-1/4.</p>
<p>The company, citing labor problems at its LANSystems division, said it sees net income between $600,000 and $900,000, up from $300,000 in 1995 but below expectations.</p>
<p>The company said Montgomery Securities lowered its rating to a hold from a buy. The analyst was not immediately available.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
